# Squimbo — i18n (en + pl)

Every new or edited user-visible string goes through i18n in **both** `en` (default) and `pl`.

| What | Where |
|------|--------|
| Catalogs | `apps/activity/src/i18n/messages/en.ts` and `pl.ts` |
| Runtime | `t("dot.path")` from `apps/activity/src/i18n/index.ts` |
| Locale | Discord `?locale=` first, else `navigator.language`; `pl` / `pl-*` → Polish |

Same key paths and `{placeholders}` in both files. Native Polish rhythm — not a literal EN calque.

Prompts in Postgres are **English-only in MVP** (`locale = en` check). Author Polish `bodyPl` next to each English body in `packages/db/prisma/prompt-bank.ts` for later; do not insert `pl` rows until product says so. UI chrome still uses the catalogs above. Editorial bar: [docs/prompt-content.md](../../docs/prompt-content.md).
